Security pins the lockfile cannot carry on its own.

package-lock.json belongs to the pinned upstream submodule, so Renovate has no
path to these versions - it cannot update a patch hunk without destroying the
hunk's coordinates. js-yaml 4.3.0 and body-parser 2.3.0 (with the content-type
2.0.0 their dependents require) are pinned here instead, and the stack-apply
test asserts the assembled runtime still resolves to them: an upstream bump
that moves them back fails there rather than shipping.

